1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Partying is weakness for the soul my friend so I try and avoid it.

2
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:12,599
I have given every single thing, every ounce of my life to this craft, to perfecting my craft and I continue to do so.

3
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:15,099
And in the process I have lost my mind.

4
00:00:15,979 --> 00:00:23,100
To regular society, to people who wake up at 9am, who clock out at 5pm.

5
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,939
they would look at me and say I've lost my mind.

6
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,559
But me, I have found it almost.

7
00:00:29,379 --> 00:00:30,659
My name is Conor McGregor.

8
00:00:30,839 --> 00:00:32,479
I'm a professional MMA fighter.

9
00:00:32,859 --> 00:00:35,219
My dream is to be world lightweight champion in the UFC.

10
00:00:36,739 --> 00:00:38,019
My dream is to be number one.

